{"type":"message","id":"3b320164","parentId":"4224b504","timestamp":"2026-04-07T00:00:04.059Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:0f2e06c5-425c-40b2-845b-135e47277fe1 github-repo-daily-briefing] 매일 09:00 KST 기준으로 GitHub 인기 레포 브리핑을 생성해 Sam에게 한국어로 전달하세요. 반드시 GitHub API(gh api 또는 공식 REST)로 실제 데이터를 조회하세요. 출력 형식: (1) 최근 인기 Top 5(최근 7일 생성 + stars 기준), (2) 누적 스타 상위 Top 5(archived 제외, 가능하면 최근 활동 있는 레포 우선), (3) 각 레포 핵심 설명 1~2문장(무엇/왜 중요한지), (4) OpenClaw 또는 Claude Code에 바로 적용 가능한 아이디어 3~5개(자동화/보안/개발생산성 관점), (5) 오늘 바로 실행할 액션 3개. 중복 레포는 한 번만 노출하고 전체 2500자 이내로 간결하게 작성하세요.\nCurrent time: Tuesday, April 7th, 2026 — 9:00 AM (Asia/Seoul) / 2026-04-07 00:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775520004053}}
{"type":"message","id":"f7e7669b","parentId":"3b320164","timestamp":"2026-04-07T00:00:40.132Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to execute a cron job that generates a GitHub trending repositories briefing in Korean. Let me break down the requirements:\n\n1. Time: Daily at 09:00 KST (current time is exactly 09:00 KST on April 7, 2026)\n2. Target: Sam\n3. Language: Korean\n4. Data source: GitHub API (gh api or official REST)\n5. Output format:\n   - (1) Recent trending Top 5 (created within last 7 days, sorted by stars)\n   - (2) All-time Top 5 by stars (exclude archived, prefer active repos)\n   - (3) Core description for each repo (1-2 sentences: what it is and why it matters)\n   - (4) 3-5 ideas immediately applicable to OpenClaw or Claude Code (automation/security/dev productivity perspective)\n   - (5) 3 actions to execute today\n6. Constraints: No duplicate repos, keep under 2500 characters total\n7. Delivery: Plain text (will be delivered automatically)\n\nI need to:\n1. Use the GitHub API to fetch trending repositories\n2. Get recent repositories (last 7 days) sorted by stars\n3. Get top repositories by stars (excluding archived)\n4. Compile the information in the specified format\n5. Write it in Korean\n6. Keep it under 2500 characters\n\nLet me start by fetching the data. I'll use the `gh` CLI tool since it's mentioned as an option.\n\nFor trending repositories, I can use:\n- `gh search repos --sort stars --order desc --limit 100 \"created:>2026-03-31\"` for repos created in last 7 days\n- For all-time top, I can search and filter by stars, excluding archived\n\nActually, GitHub doesn't have a native \"trending\" API. I'll need to use search with appropriate filters.\n\nLet me start with the queries:\n1. Recent trending: created in last 7 days (from 2026-03-31 to now)\n\n\n2. All-time top: exclude archived repositories and prioritize recent activity\n\nI'll refine my approach to find the most relevant repositories across different timeframes. I'll focus on precise GitHub search queries that capture both recent and established trending repositories while ensuring comprehensive coverage.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub 브리핑 생성을 시작합니다."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6dc95823b670465eac217e62","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh search repos --sort stars --order desc --limit 20 \"created:>2026-03-31\" --json name,description,stargazerCount,url,createdAt,primaryLanguage,isArchived"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":18806,"output":1018,"cacheRead":5289,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25113,"cost":{"input":0.0112836,"output":0.0022396,"cacheRead":0.00058179,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01410499}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775520004059,"responseId":"20260407080005115a39479d9947e9"}}
